# oracle: examples/bpm/peri/in.bpm.peri.eps cut down to a 0.0015-radius cylinder of 319 nodes (LAMMPS b332f28, GPL-2.0 example
# input, reduced size). bond_style bpm/peri eps (K = G = 1e6, yield stress 1e8, horizon 0.0015001, s00 5e-4, alpha 0.25), pair_style bpm/peri contact, fix property/atom d_vfrac d_damage. The example's
# indenter is not used: its K = 1e17 indenter at dt = 1e-7 (and the example's K = 14.9e9 moduli at any dt this run can
# afford) blows the cut-down target apart within a few steps in native LAMMPS, so the bonds are broken by a 2e-5 m
# displacement of the top layer after a setup run (the w59bpm pattern) at dt = 1e-10, which is stable for these moduli.
# Native damage after 40 steps: 0.984 (native: /home/roy/.local/bin/lmp, b332f28, has BPM and PERI).
# Measured max relative error vs native: thermo 3.4e-13, positions/velocities 2.1e-13 at most, forces 1.9e-12 (each relative to the largest value of its column). Engine time: 2.6 s (one case, 40 steps).
# The forces are skipped by the per-atom compare (atomskip) because the net force of some nodes is a cancellation of
# terms of order 1e6 to 1e8 N: the absolute differences of 1e-6 N are then roundoff, and the scale-free error above is
# the measured parity.
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10 atomskip=fx,fy,fz
units           si
dimension       3
boundary        f f f
atom_style      bond
atom_modify     map array
special_bonds   lj 0.0 1.0 1.0 coul 0.0 1.0 1.0
newton          on off
neighbor        0.0010 bin
comm_modify     cutoff 0.0030
lattice         sc 0.0005
region          box block -0.006 0.006 -0.006 0.002 -0.006 0.006 units box
region          target cylinder y 0.0 0.0 0.0015 -0.0050 0.0 units box
create_box      1 box bond/types 1 extra/bond/per/atom 130 extra/special/per/atom 150
create_atoms    1 region target
mass            * 2.75e-7
fix             vol all property/atom d_vfrac d_damage ghost yes
set             group all d_vfrac 1.25e-10
pair_style      bpm/peri
pair_coeff * * 1.6863e13 0.0015001
create_bonds    many all all 1 0.0 0.0015001
special_bonds   lj 0.0 1.0 1.0 coul 1.0 1.0 1.0
bond_style      bpm/peri
bond_coeff      1 eps 1e6 1e6 1e8 0.0015001 0.0005 0.25
velocity        all set 0.0 0.0 0.0 sum no units box
fix             1 all nve
region          top block -0.006 0.006 -0.0004 0.002 -0.006 0.006 units box
group           top region top
compute         dmg all property/atom d_damage
compute         davg all reduce ave c_dmg
compute         nb all nbond/atom
compute         tb all reduce sum c_nb
timestep        1e-10
thermo          10
thermo_style    custom step atoms pe ebond c_davg c_tb
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo_modify   lost ignore
thermo_modify   lost/bond ignore
run             0
displace_atoms  top move 0.0 -2.0e-5 0.0 units box
run             40
